","nomenclaturename":"cytochrome c oxidase associated subunit FA4L3","nomenclaturestatus":"Official","nomenclaturesymbol":"COXFA4L3","organism":{"commonname":"human","scientificname":"Homo sapiens","taxid":9606},"otheraliases":"C15orf48, FOAP-11, MIR147BHG, MISTRAV, MOCCI, NMES1","otherdesignations":"cytochrome c oxidase associated subunit FA4L3|MIR147B host|cytochrome c oxidase subunit FA4 like 3|mitochondrial stress response antiviral|modulator of cytochrome C oxidase during inflammation|modulator of cytochrome C oxidase during inflammation protein|normal mucosa of esophagus specific 1|normal mucosa of esophagus-specific gene 1 protein","status":"","summary":"This gene was first identified in a study of human esophageal squamous cell carcinoma tissues. Levels of both the message and protein are reduced in carcinoma samples. In adult human tissues, this gene is expressed in the the esophagus, stomach, small intestine, colon and placenta. Alternatively spliced transcript variants that encode the same protein have been identified. [provided by RefSeq, Jun 2012]","uid":"84419"},"90527":{"chromosome":"15","chrsort":"15","chrstart":45117365,"currentid":"","description":"dual oxidase maturation factor 1","geneticsource":"genomic","geneweight":813,"genomicinfo":[{"chraccver":"NC_000015.10","chrloc":"15","chrstart":45129878,"chrstop":45117365,"exoncount":11}],"locationhist":[{"annotationrelease":"RS_2025_08","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.40","chraccver":"NC_000015.10","chrstart":45129878,"chrstop":45117365},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2025_08","assemblyaccver":"GCF_009914755.1","chraccver":"NC_060939.1","chrstart":42937901,"chrstop":42925386},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2024_08","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.40","chraccver":"NC_000015.10","chrstart":45129878,"chrstop":45117365},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2024_08","assemblyaccver":"GCF_009914755.1","chraccver":"NC_060939.1","chrstart":42937901,"chrstop":42925386},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2023_10","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.40","chraccver":"NC_000015.10","chrstart":45129878,"chrstop":45117365},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2023_10","assemblyaccver":"GCF_009914755.1","chraccver":"NC_060939.1","chrstart":42937901,"chrstop":42925386},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2023_03","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.40","chraccver":"NC_000015.10","chrstart":45129878,"chrstop":45117365},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2023_03","assemblyaccver":"GCF_009914755.1","chraccver":"NC_060939.1","chrstart":42937901,"chrstop":42925386},{"annotationrelease":"110","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.40","chraccver":"NC_000015.10","chrstart":45129878,"chrstop":45117365},{"annotationrelease":"110","assemblyaccver":"GCF_009914755.1","chraccver":"NC_060939.1","chrstart":42937900,"chrstop":42925386},{"annotationrelease":"109.20211119","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.39","chraccver":"NC_000015.10","chrstart":45129937,"chrstop":45117365},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2024_09","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.25","chraccver":"NC_000015.9","chrstart":45422076,"chrstop":45409563},{"annotationrelease":"105.20220307","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.25","chraccver":"NC_000015.9","chrstart":45422076,"chrstop":45409563},{"annotationrelease":"105","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.25","chraccver":"NC_000015.9","chrstart":45422074,"chrstop":45409563},{"annotationrelease":"105","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000002125.1","chraccver":"AC_000147.1","chrstart":22246287,"chrstop":22233775},{"annotationrelease":"105","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000306695.2","chraccver":"NC_018926.2","chrstart":45540407,"chrstop":45527896}],"maplocation":"15q21.1","mim":["612771"],"name":"DUOXA1","nomenclaturename":"dual oxidase maturation factor 1","nomenclaturestatus":"Official","nomenclaturesymbol":"DUOXA1","organism":{"commonname":"human","scientificname":"Homo sapiens","taxid":9606},"otheraliases":"NIP, NUMBIP, mol","otherdesignations":"dual oxidase maturation factor 1|dual oxidase activator 1|dual oxidase maturation factor 1 alpha|dual oxidase maturation factor 1 beta|dual oxidase maturation factor 1 delta|dual oxidase maturation factor 1 gamma|homolog of Drosophila Numb-interacting protein","status":"","summary":"Dual oxidases DUOX1 and DUOX2 are NADPH oxidases which are involved in hydrogen peroxide production necessary for thyroid hormonogenesis. They form a heterodimer with specific maturation factors DUOXA1 and DUOXA2, respectively, which is essential for the maturation and function of the DUOX enzyme complexes. This gene encodes the DUOX1 activator or maturation factor DUOXA1. Rat studies identified a bidirectional promoter which controls the transcription of the DUOX1 and DUOXA1 genes. This protein is cotransported to the cell surface when coexpressed with DUOX1 and is retained in the endoplasmic reticulum when expressed without DUOX1 protein. The expression of this gene or the DUOX1 gene is not suppressed by thyroglobulin (Tg), a macromolecular precursor in thyroid hormone synthesis, while the expression of the DUOX2 and DUOXA2 are significantly suppressed by the Tg. This protein is also a p53-regulated neurogenic factor involved in p53 dependent neuronal differentiation. Multiple alternatively spliced transcript variants encoding different isoforms have been found for this gene. [provided by RefSeq, Jan 2013]","uid":"90527"},"9153":{"chromosome":"15","chrsort":"15","chrstart":45252233,"currentid":"","description":"solute carrier family 28 member 2","geneticsource":"genomic","geneweight":1459,"genomicinfo":[{"chraccver":"NC_000015.10","chrloc":"15","chrstart":45252233,"chrstop":45277845,"exoncount":18}],"locationhist":[{"annotationrelease":"RS_2025_08","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.40","chraccver":"NC_000015.10","chrstart":45252233,"chrstop":45277845},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2025_08","assemblyaccver":"GCF_009914755.1","chraccver":"NC_060939.1","chrstart":43060157,"chrstop":43086085},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2024_08","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.40","chraccver":"NC_000015.10","chrstart":45252233,"chrstop":45277845},{"annotationrelease":"R