17153, SPNT1","otherdesignations":"sodium/nucleoside cotransporter 2|CNT 2|Na(+)/nucleoside cotransporter 2|SPNT|concentrative nucleoside transporter 2|sodium-coupled nucleoside transporter 2|sodium/purine nucleoside co-transporter|solute carrier family 28 (concentrative nucleoside transporter), member 2|solute carrier family 28 (sodium-coupled nucleoside transporter), member 2","status":"","summary":"Enables neurotransmitter transmembrane transporter activity and nucleoside transmembrane transporter activity. Involved in neurotransmitter transport; nucleoside transport; and purine nucleobase transmembrane transport. Located in apicolateral plasma membrane. [provided by Alliance of Genome Resources, Jul 2025]","uid":"9153"},"uids":["90527","145645","6652","9153","84419","58472","105751187","79656"]}}
